# Exocortex project-local runtime/evidence data (never template code plane)
.exocortex/local/

# Exocortex - Event System
# Phase 1 (1-2 months): Track active events via git for cross-machine sync
# Phase 2 (after RAG API): Switch to RAG-based sync, stop committing events
# Only ignore backups (not needed in repo)
.exocortex/SESSION_CONTEXT_BACKUP_*.md

# Note: Archive directory is tracked during Phase 1 for complete cross-machine sync
# Will be ignored in Phase 2 when RAG API becomes primary sync mechanism
.exocortex/events/*.synced
